# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client + Server fallback)
# Obtain a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key for prototyping:
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms and generate your key
# 4. Copy the key below into a local .env.local file (never commit .env.local)
#
# For production, create and restrict a key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Map Tiles API, Places API (New), Elevation API
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Optional dedicated server-side key for Next.js Route Handlers (/api/places/*, /api/elevation/*)
# If omitted, server routes fall back to NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_server_google_maps_api_key_here
